---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { SITE, HAS_PHONE, HAS_EMAIL } from '../config';
const updated = 'August 2026';
---
<BaseLayout title={`Terms & Conditions | ${SITE.brand}`} description="Terms of use for the Tree Service Hickory NC website." breadcrumb="Terms & Conditions">
  <section>
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px">
      <Breadcrumbs label="Terms & Conditions" />
      <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p><em>Last updated {updated}.</em></p>

      <p>The terms below cover your use of {SITE.domain}. The site is operated by
      {SITE.brand}. By using this site you accept the terms below.</p>

      <h2>What this website is</h2>
      <p>Information about the work we do, and a way to get in touch. Nothing on it is a
      contract, an offer, or a quote.</p>

      <h2>⚠️ Prices on this site are ranges, not quotes</h2>
      <p><strong>Every figure on this site is a range showing what projects like yours have
      cost.</strong> A price range is not a price for your project and it is not binding on either of us.</p>
      <p>What a tree job actually costs depends on the tree and the access. That covers the tree's size
      and species, whether it comes down whole or has to be rigged down in sections, how close it
      stands to a structure or power line, and how a crane or bucket truck reaches the property.</p>
      <p><strong>A real number comes from a site visit and a written quote.</strong> Only a signed
      written agreement creates a contract between us.</p>

      <h2>Accuracy</h2>
      <p>We try hard to keep this site correct and current, including anything we say about
      products, materials, timescales or permitting. Product details change over time, and
      manufacturers change their specifications without telling us. If something here matters to
      your decision, confirm it with us before
      you rely on it.</p>

      <h2>Submitting an inquiry</h2>
      <p>Give us accurate details, and only submit someone else's contact information if they
      have agreed. Sending an inquiry does not oblige us to take the work, and it does not oblige
      you to hire us.</p>
      <p>We may pass your inquiry to another contractor if the work is not right for us, and we may
      receive a referral fee if we do. Referrals of that kind are set out in our
      <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>, and you can tell us at any time not to make
      them.</p>

      <h2>Our content</h2>
      <p>The text, photographs, logo and design on this site belong to us or are used with
      permission. Please do not republish them without asking us first.</p>
      <p><strong>About the photographs:</strong> images on this site are used to illustrate the
      kinds of tree work we do. Unless a caption specifically says so, they are
      not photographs of our own completed projects.</p>

      <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
      <p>Where we link somewhere else, we do not control that site and are not responsible for it.</p>

      <h2>Liability</h2>
      <p>The website is provided as it is, and to the extent the law allows, we are not liable for
      loss arising from relying on information on it. Nothing here limits any liability that
      cannot legally be limited, and none of this affects your rights under a signed contract
      with us.</p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>The terms on this page are governed by the laws of the State of North Carolina.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms; the date at the top will change when we do.</p>

      <h2>Text message (SMS) service</h2>
      <p>{SITE.brand} sends text message updates and responses to customers about pricing
      and products offered at {SITE.domain}.</p>
      <p>When you opt in to the service, we may send you a message to confirm your signup. Message
      and data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Text "HELP" for help. Text "STOP" to
      cancel. You can cancel this service at any time — just text "STOP" to the number you
      received messages from. After you send the message "STOP" to us, we will reply to confirm
      that you have been unsubscribed. After this, you will no longer receive messages from us. If
      you want to join again, just sign up as you did the first time, and we will start sending
      you messages again.</p>
      <p>If at any time you forget what keywords are supported, just text "HELP" to the number you
      received messages from. After you send the message "HELP" to us, we will respond with
      instructions on how to use our service and how to unsubscribe.</p>
      <p>Participating carriers: AT&amp;T, Verizon Wireless, Sprint, T-Mobile, U.S. Cellular, Boost
      Mobile, MetroPCS, Virgin Mobile, Alaska Communications Systems (ACS), Appalachian Wireless
      (EKN), Bluegrass Cellular, Cellular One of East Central, IL (ECIT), Cellular One of Northeast
      Pennsylvania, Cricket, Coral Wireless (Mobi PCS), COX, Cross, Element Mobile (Flat Wireless),
      Epic Touch (Elkhart Telephone), GCI, Golden State, Hawkeye (Chat Mobility), Hawkeye (NW
      Missouri), Illinois Valley Cellular, Inland Cellular, iWireless (Iowa Wireless), Keystone
      Wireless (Immix Wireless/PC Man), Mosaic (Consolidated or CTC Telecom), Nex-Tech Wireless,
      NTelos, Panhandle Communications, Pioneer, Plateau (Texas RSA 3 Ltd), Revol, RINA, Simmetry
      (TMP Corporation), Thumb Cellular, Union Wireless, United Wireless, Viaero Wireless, and West
      Central (WCC or 5 Star Wireless).</p>
      <p>Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</p>
      <p>If you have any questions regarding privacy, please read our
      <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>Content on this website is provided for general information only. Service
      descriptions, timeframes and price ranges are indicative and do not constitute a
      quotation, a warranty, or professional advice for any specific property. Every job
      is priced and scoped after an on-site assessment.</p>
      <p>Tree work carries inherent risk and site conditions vary. Guidance on this site
      is not a substitute for an assessment by a qualified arborist, and no liability is
      accepted for action taken on the basis of it without one.</p>
      <p>Local conditions, ordinances and permit requirements change. Figures cited here
      are believed accurate at the time of writing and are not a substitute for a current
      check with the relevant authority.</p>
      <p>Photographs may illustrate the type of work described rather than a specific
      completed job.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>{HAS_EMAIL && <><a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>{HAS_PHONE ? ' · ' : ''}</>}
      {HAS_PHONE && <a href={SITE.phoneHref}>{SITE.phone}</a>}
      {!HAS_EMAIL && !HAS_PHONE && <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a>}</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
